store shop  prefix (none)  account 123456789012  regions us-east-1, us-west-2
-- want/archive_in_another_group.stdout --
us-east-1: catalog 895545e36890, local ecccd95ebe0b
  stream signups: archive changed
  stream signups: archive stopped in us-west-2
us-west-2: catalog ecccd95ebe0b, the same as the local one
